  "system": {
    "identifier": "lyonesse-knight-of-the-sacred-word-voice-of-authority",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your voice carries force that can command the body as surely as your strikes. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with a Monk weapon or an Unarmed Strike, you can expend 1 Focus Point to issue a single-word command as part of the attack. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or suffer one of the following effects of your choice until the start of your next turn:</p><p><strong>Halt.</strong> The creature’s Speed becomes 0.</p><p><strong>Silence.</strong> The creature cannot speak or cast spells with Verbal components.</p><p><strong>Yield.</strong> The creature has Disadvantage on attack rolls.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.9c6810d93ecf51f2]{Halt}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.35abd93821c779d7]{Silence}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.d97b8c06fa05e422]{Yield}</li></ul>"
    },
    "source": {
